+ * its blur is lighter than frosted glass's and it has no grain, nearer that clear glass (AIOStreamsTVOS).
+ */
+html[data-flat-liquid] .glass-surface[data-surface='liquid'],
+html[data-flat-liquid][data-art-wash][data-art-glass='liquid']:not(.playing)
